   295	**Mechanism (new, and not in the charged reports).** The factored `KJ` gives, once
   296	`B_0 = ... = B_{n-2} = 0`,
   297	
   298	```text
   299	[t^n] KJ = A_0^3 [ 99 A_0 B_{n-1,w} - (99-3n) B_{n-1} A_{0,w} ],
   300	A_0 = w^9 (w-1)^24,
   301	```
