   196	
   197	The D108 controls compiler was also rerun:
   198	`box/g108gate-20260903/controls-run/controls.json`, SHA-256
   199	`b9cca023bbc276453ea2b9c51c37a9d4e748c008da06f66bb48564cb04da0537`.
   200	Both Appendix-II `Q` localizations are empty with raw/empty/point/lift controls
   201	passing.  The tame affine control survives:
   202	
   203	```text
