   211	
   212	## Outer Constants
   213	
   214	Raw monic unknowns are confirmed at `8694`, and fixed-top unknowns at `8514`.
   215	This agrees with the Grok bridge
   216	`/tmp/jc2-lane.66ch7X/inputs/g108-outer-bridge-grok46-20260903.md:36`.
   217	
