The backward trace is much smaller than the full chart. For `δ=2`, the conservative DAG has 128 candidate source nodes, but exact coefficient pruning collapses the certificate to eight rows; notably all 98 visited B₁ order zero-facts cancel. I’m now checking the analogous distinction for `δ=5/2`, where the seven stage-8 Jacobian pivots turn out to be chronological neighbors, not ancestors of the terminal pole row.
