@@ -0,0 +1,56 @@
+# Certificate slice: three two-place obstruction cores
+
+Status: **UNSEALED SKELETON**.  The terminal seal marker is deliberately
+absent until all replay and negative controls pass.
+
+## Scope, frozen inputs, and conventions
+
+## Executive result
+
+| kill | terminal unit / residues | minimal slice | deepest `t` | outer coefficients | bridge rows | verdict |
+|---|---|---:|---:|---|---|---|
