+| skeleton / level | shape | rank | kernel |
+|---|---:|---:|---|
+| `(99,66)`, `n=4` | `66 x 34` | 34 | 0 |
+| `(99,66)`, `n=11` | `66 x 34` | 33 | `Q*w^6(w-1)^16` |
+| `D=108`, `n=9` | `72 x 37` | 36 | `Q*w^6(w-1)^21` |
+
