+### 4.3 Minimal localized certificate
+
+With `L=Zc*c-1`, the readable certificate is
+
+```text
+1 = -(9/2)*jet1*jet2*Zc*r71 - Zc*r80
+    -(1/2)*jet1^2*Zc*r81 - L.
+```
+
+Strict support pruning removes `r71`.  Put
