+| `(99,66), delta=5/2` | post-outer-`D2`, declared common-`h3` map | `(0,0,1,6,0)` = **7** | 36-row joint DAG; `D1` lifts 38/43; `h3` audits 11/17 | 8 (`s^16`) | none | none |
