+### 1.2 Backward DAG and certificate lift
+
+Write a pivot source row as
+
+```text
+R_v = a_v x_v + b_v,   a_v in Q*,   x_v = -b_v/a_v.
+```
+
+When a later row `T` contains `x_v`, substitution is recorded as the exact
+row operation
+
+```text
+T|_{x_v=-b_v/a_v}
+  = T - ((T-T|_{x_v=-b_v/a_v})/R_v) R_v.
+```
