+This is one functorial **filtered map schema**, not one literal same-sized
+matrix.  The page at which its cokernel acquires a unit changes with the
+skeleton, exactly the filtration-page alternative anticipated in
+`ideation-20260904T0000Z-sol56.md:633-654`.
