+```text
+incidence < outer order-zero facts < pole < Jacobian < localization,
+```
+
+homogenizing affine rows with one constant column, and eliminating only
+nonzero rational `Q*` pivots.  The first nonzero obstruction appears on
+different pages: the common-`h3` incidence page for `D=108`, a pole/Jacobian
+page at normalized `t`-power 4 for `(99,66), delta=2`, and a pole Schur page
+whose construction reaches normalized `t`-power 8 for `(99,66), delta=5/2`.
