+### 4.2 Seven pivots and residues
+
+Exact `Q*` elimination gives
+
+| pivot row | variable | coefficient | resolved value |
+|---|---|---:|---|
+| `(1,0)` | `Hc_1_7` | -1 | 0 |
+| `(2,0)` | `Hc_2_6` | 1 | 0 |
+| `(3,0)` | `Hc_3_6` | 1 | 0 |
