+w=t*y=jet1*t^2+jet2*t^3+pi*t^4,
+K3=-t^8*(pi^2-c)+O(t^9),
+```
+
+and uses the exact contribution rule
+
+```text
+a[r,j] * multinomial(j;a,b,k) * jet1^a*jet2^b*pi^k
+at t-power r+2a+3b+4k,   a+b+k=j.
+```
