+## 4. Kill C: `D=108, delta=3`
+
+### 4.1 Standalone common-`h3` expansion
+
+This replay imports no campaign engine or ledger.  Starting with the
+seven-coordinate post-major chart for `w^2(w-1)^7`, it converts `z=w-1` to
+`w`, substitutes
