+```text
+J(162,35), J(162,36), J(161,35), J(161,36), J(160,35), J(159,35).
+```
+
+Hence the support-minimal identity in this quotient is
+
+```text
+1 = P/64 - (a1*J(162,35)+a2*J(162,36)+a3*J(161,35)
+             +a4*J(161,36)+a5*J(160,35)+a6*J(159,35))/64.
+```
