+All eight `D1` entries and 29 of the 35 Jacobian entries of `alpha` vanish.
+Writing `K521=K2c_5_21`, `K620=K2c_6_20`, `K621=K2c_6_21`, and
+`K719,K720,K721` similarly, the six nonzero entries are
