+```text
+1 = displayed identity + 0*(Zc*c-1).
+```
+
+Perturbing the consumed row `J(159,35)` by `+B1c_3_22` changes the frozen
+certificate to `1+B1c_3_22/6264`; the control therefore fails exactly as it
