+| pivot row | variable | coefficient | resolved value |
+|---|---|---:|---|
+| `(1,0)` | `Hc_1_7` | -1 | 0 |
+| `(2,0)` | `Hc_2_6` | 1 | 0 |
+| `(3,0)` | `Hc_3_6` | 1 | 0 |
+| `(4,0)` | `Hc_4_5` | -1 | `jet1^2` |
+| `(5,0)` | `Hc_5_4` | 1 | 0 |
+| `(5,1)` | `Hc_1_8` | -1 | 0 |
+| `(6,1)` | `Hc_2_7` | 1 | `2*jet1` |
